export anchor VaporwavePastelStyle:
    number: 65
    screen: Onboarding
    name: Vaporwave pastel
    idea: Retro computer windows float over a pastel sunset with a pink grid horizon, a striped sun and a marble bust, so setup feels like a dreamy 1990s desktop.
    base: light
    palette:
        skyPink: #ffd6ec, the top of the sky gradient
        hotPastel: #ff9ed2, title bar start, the Continue button and horizon grid lines
        cyan: #bff3ff, the seat note and icon fills
        cyanDeep: #7fe3f7, title bar end, the Copy invite link button and the focus glow
        lavender: #e7dcff, secondary buttons, the list header and the current step
        window: #fbf7ff, window bodies
        bevel: #9b84c4, the dark edge of every bevel
        ink: #2d1747, text and window frames
        plum: #5a3d7a, meta text, labels and line art
        mintInk: #0f6b5c, the Done and Added words
        magentaInk: #b0186e, the Running now and Typing words and the eyebrow
        grape: #6a2c91, progress blocks, used seats and links
    type:
        Tahoma, Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif for the interface at 15px with
        1.5 line height. The heading uses Arial Black, Gadget, Verdana at
        38px weight 900 with 6 percent tracking, and a cyan 3px and pink
        minus 2px offset text shadow. Title bars are 13px bold. The eyebrow
        and section labels are 12px bold caps with 35 percent tracking. A
        decorative line of spaced katakana sits under the heading.
    layout:
        A full width scene with a pink to lavender to cyan sky, a striped
        sun in the middle, a pink perspective grid floor in the lower
        third, a simple marble bust with tinted shades bottom left and a
        cyan palm bottom right. On top sits a slim beveled taskbar with the
        brand and Mara Okafor. Below it two windows, a 280px setup.progress
        window with a segmented block meter and the four steps, and a wide
        invite_team.exe window with the eyebrow, heading, line, a list view
        with Email, Role and Status columns, the seat note, then Copy
        invite link left and Back, Skip for now and Continue right. Below
        900px the windows stack and the bust shrinks.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px window padding, 32px between windows, 8px list cell padding.
    density: Medium. Invites sit in a file manager style list view with column headers.
    corners: Square everywhere. The sun is the only circle.
    borders:
        A 2px ink frame on windows, buttons and fields, plus a 2px bevel
        with white on the top left and #9b84c4 on the bottom right. Fields
        and the list are sunken with a lavender inner shadow. The seat note
        has a 2px dashed ink border.
    shadows: A flat 8px 8px offset with no blur in magenta at 22 percent behind every window.
    icons:
        Chunky 16 to 20px glyphs with 2px ink outlines and pastel fills. A
        ticked square marks done, a pink play triangle marks the current
        step and dashed squares mark queued steps. Added shows a tick, and
        Typing shows three fading bars. Window buttons are tiny beveled
        boxes and arrows are text triangles.
    focus: A 2px dotted ink outline offset 2px plus a 5px cyan glow ring.
    tone: Computer speak with a wink, such as setup.progress, invite_team.exe, Running now and Queued.
